WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:02.900
- Today I'm here to go against

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.690
everything I've ever said on my channel,

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.970
and to ask you guys to please

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:10.910
stop meeting strangers, for now.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.840
Let's just, let's take a little break.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.720
I know things suck right now,

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.880
and everything feels really weird,

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.870
like it's hard to put
into words how I feel.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:23.170
Like the other day I just
started crying for no reason,

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:24.980
like literally nothing had happened,

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:27.940
I was just sitting there
and I started crying.

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:29.913
I keep zoning out multiple times a day,

00:00:29.913 --> 00:00:31.840
and when I snap back into it

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.610
I can't even remember
what I was thinking about.

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:35.270
Like are you guys going
through this as well

00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:36.103
or is it just me?

00:00:36.103 --> 00:00:37.890
At least every night I have a nightmare

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:41.688
and when I wake up, it feels
like I'm waiting to wake up

00:00:41.688 --> 00:00:44.660
from another nightmare, but I never do.

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.000
This must be a little weird

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.200
because my channel is about other people.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.088
And I never share anything about myself.

00:00:51.088 --> 00:00:53.810
But I'm doing that today to show

00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:55.770
that we're all in this together,

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:57.870
and to emphasize the importance

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:00.880
of what I'm about to ask you guys to do.

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:03.290
The kindest thing you can do for yourself,

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:06.920
the people you love, and
strangers you'll never meet

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.970
is to follow the protocols.

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:13.630
Social distancing, please stay
away from social settings.

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:15.960
Wash your hands, don't touch your face.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:18.300
I know this is hard because
we're all social beings.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.850
Trust me, I would know,

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:22.380
I meet about 400 new people every week.

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:24.580
But it's really important that we do this.

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:25.600
When you're at a store,

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:28.080
and you wanna grab the
last two hand sanitizers,

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:30.287
just remember that the
stranger next to you

00:01:30.287 --> 00:01:34.030
is just as scared and in
need of the hand sanitizer.

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:36.630
So take one, leave one for them.

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:39.690
Something common, I just touched my face.

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:42.288
Something common I've been
hearing from young people

00:01:42.288 --> 00:01:44.450
is that they shouldn't be worried

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:47.310
because coronavirus isn't gonna kill them,

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:49.770
but what about your mom
and your grandparents,

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:53.420
and people who have a
compromised immune system.

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:55.200
If you're not worried about yourself,

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:58.590
please keep in mind people
who are the most vulnerable.

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:00.230
I already know some people are gonna say

00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:02.300
that people like me are overreacting,

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:05.770
and that there's no need
for videos like this,

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:07.810
and I hope you're right, honestly.

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:10.800
I hope that in a month all
the comments on this video

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:12.800
are making fun of how much

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:14.930
I overreacted about the coronavirus.

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:16.040
Because that would mean

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:18.040
that there was some sort
of solution by then.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:20.270
I genuinely hope that's the case.

00:02:20.270 --> 00:02:21.863
But if that's not the case,

00:02:21.863 --> 00:02:26.000
then I couldn't live with myself knowing

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.340
that I could have done more.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:31.080
I honestly do think that
our actions right now

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.050
could literally save lives.

00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:34.863
And we can all be heroes.

00:02:34.863 --> 00:02:37.390
I know we always imagine heroic acts

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:39.690
as like jumping in front of a car

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:41.343
to push someone out of the way,

00:02:42.525 --> 00:02:45.860
but just think now you don't
have to risk your own life

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.830
to save someone else's life.

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:52.010
In fact, you might even be
saving your life as well,

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:53.275
so it's just way cooler.

00:02:53.275 --> 00:02:57.800
With that said, I will
continue to post every Thursday

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:00.190
here on my channel, meeting new strangers,

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:03.960
I'm just kidding, I'm not
meeting strangers anymore,

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:05.410
face to face at least.

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:07.620
Instead I'll be asking you guys

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:10.300
to send in videos, or
to send me your numbers

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.520
so I could FaceTime you.

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:14.150
And I'll announce the topic
for that week's episode

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:16.090
either on here, on my YouTube channel

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.450
in the community section,

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:20.780
or on my Instagram and my Twitter,

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:21.940
mainly my Instagram,

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:23.880
I still don't really
know how to use Twitter.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:26.300
I think it's important with
everything that's happening

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:30.060
for the first topic we
discuss to be the coronavirus.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.710
So if you've personally been affected

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:32.800
by the coronavirus,

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:34.860
and you're willing to share your story,

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:38.723
please email me at
thorayaproject@gmail.com.

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:43.420
Yeah, that's all guys,
thank you for everything.

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:46.490
Be kind, stay safe, I love you all,

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:48.453
and I'll see you next Thursday.

